    "sections": {
        "description": "Templazee Herbs is a modern, Full Site Editing (FSE) WordPress child theme of Templaze, thoughtfully crafted for indoor plant shops and botanical stores. Designed with plant enthusiasts and shop owners in mind, this theme offers a clean, fresh aesthetic that highlights greenery and nature-inspired products beautifully. Fully compatible with WooCommerce, Templazee Herbs makes setting up an online plant store seamless and visually appealing. It's built for speed and optimized for SEO, helping your site perform well in search engines and deliver a fast, smooth browsing experience across all modern browsers."
    },
